//                      ai_validating mutex) and merge priority FIRST, ahead
//                      of older medium PRs;
//   medium  (rank 1) — the default tier: a PR with NO priority label is
//                      medium (the medium label is NOT required to exist);
//   low     (rank 2) — sinks below all mediums.
